<title>MALTA: Technical problem stops Malta trading session.</title>
<headline>Technical problem stops Malta trading session.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The once weekly trading session of the Malta Stock Exchange was called off on Wednesday and moved to Friday because of a technical fault. The Malta stock exchange said the trading session could not be completed.</p>
</text>
